title: LilGuy_Respite
---
<<if visited("Bad_Outcome") == true>>
Nubs: Today is still better than all the other days I have lived in the lab.
<<endif>>
<<if visited("Bad_Outcome") == false>>
<<expression Nubs arms_happy>>
Nubs: Today is the best day ever.
<<endif>>
<<declare $lilday = 0>>
<<jump LilGuy_Day>>
===

title: LilGuy_Day
---
-> What are your days usually like? <<once>>
    <<set $lilday += 1>>
    Nubs: Undergoing 20-30 tests a day to assess my durability. As the greatest product ever developed by AGENTS, I need to withstand drowning, poison, plasma, and firestorms. 
    <<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
    Nubs: In case the place I am stored in explodes from an incoming stealth missile.
    Nubs: Then I get squeezed back into a capsule that is smaller than the pod you freed me from.
    <<expression Nubs worried>>
    Nubs: It was kinda hard to breathe in there, now that I think about it.
    <<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
    Luna: That’s inhumane. Isn’t this against a law or something?
    <<expression Nubs loading>>
    Nubs: Title XVI, Section 23, Clause 8: It is not considered worker or animal cruelty if the organism was not constructed with a bladder.
    <<expression Nubs neutral>>
    Nubs: I do not have one. So I suppose there really is no logical reason for me to leave my capsule, after all.    
    <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
    Luna: What a convenient loophole…
    <<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
    <<jump LilGuy_Day>>
-> What made today so great? <<once>>
    <<set $lilday += 1>>
    Nubs: Meeting you. And getting to see how humans live.
    // If player’s $badend score is >= 5, then show this line of text and expression below:
    <<if $badend >= 5>>
        <<expression Nubs angry>>
        Nubs: Even if you are intolerable and inhospitable at times…
        <<expression Nubs neutral>>
    <<else>>
    // If player’s $badend score is <=4, then continue with the below:
        Nubs: You have a good life.
        <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
        Luna: Don't bullshit me.
        Luna: There's nothing “good” about my life at all.
        Nubs: You do not have to be poked and stuffed into a capsule, only for the same thing to happen to you the next day. You can do whatever you want, with unrestricted access to the city.
        <<expression Nubs happy>>
        Nubs: And you’ll use that access to take me back to my master, which you promised you would do once we completed this delivery!
        Luna: …
        <<expression Nubs neutral>>
        Nubs: You are not a prototype. You are…an original. 
        <<expression Nubs worried>>
        Nubs: At least you have a purpose…
    <<endif>>
    <<jump LilGuy_Day>>
// When the two questions above have been played through, reveal this choice to continue with the main story:
<<if $lilday == 2>>
    -> What is your purpose?
        Luna: So what is your purpose? Why were YOU created?
        <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
        Luna: And don't give me that firewall crap.
        <<expression Nubs confused>>
        Nubs: But, I really cannot access those files…
        Luna: Then what do YOU want your purpose to be?
        <<expression Nubs neutral>>
        Nubs: …!
        Luna: Okay, so you can't access it. So what? What do YOU want to do?
        <<expression Nubs arms_worried>>
        Nubs: I...
        <<expression Luna_Neutral shy_neutral>>
        Luna: I know I'm supposed to drop you off at your master's, but…it doesn't seem like you even wanna go back to pokes and firestorms.
        Luna: You…deserve to live…        
        <<expression Nubs neutral>>
        Nubs: Luna…
        <<expression Luna_Neutral shy>>
        Luna: (Ugh, why am I even saying this?)
        // Stop music
        <<stopMusic>>
        <<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
        <<expression Nubs arms_neutral>>
        ???_Maxx: You deserve JAIL TIME.
<<endif>>
<<pose Luna_Neutral LunaFadeOut_BridgeBike>>
<<pose Nubs SceneSample_NubsFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Luna_Neutral>>
<<exit Nubs>>
<<fadeOut 1>>
<<jump MaxxIntro>>
===

title: MaxxIntro
---
// Play JunkYard music track
<<playMusic junkyard>>
<<camera Bridge>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<pose Luna_Neutral LunaFadeIn_BridgeBike>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
<<place CompanionNubs>>
<<expression CompanionNubs arms_neutral>>
<<place Maxx>>
<<bike Maxx on>>
<<expression Maxx neutral>>
<<wait 1>>
???_Maxx: Straight to jail.
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
Luna: Who the hell are you?
<<expression Maxx intrigued>>
Maxx: The one true ascended adonis of AGENTS, Maxx.
Maxx: Lanklets refer to me as their Chief Product Officer, but our elevated CEO prefers the new-age term “Disciple” for his executive C-suite.
<<expression CompanionNubs wave_neutral>>
Nubs: That's the guy who named me T.A.B!
Luna: …Makes sense.
<<expression CompanionNubs arms_neutral>>
<<expression Maxx neutral>>
Maxx: I finally found you after combing through AGENTS highway footage.
Maxx: You've been driving around town with company property. 
<<expression CompanionNubs arms_worried>>
Nubs: …
Maxx: If you're a smart girl, you'll hand over that pillbug and continue on with your extremely jester life.
<<expression CompanionNubs arms_worried>>

-> Over your gigachad body.
    <<set $goodend += 1>>
    <<expression Maxx intrigued>>
    Maxx: Flame me all you want, but everyone wishes they had my body and brain chemistry.
    Maxx: My jaw is made from Area 27 diamonds. No amount of mewing and semaglutides could ever get to my level.
-> And what do I get in return for handing him over?
    <<set $badend += 1>>
    <<expression Maxx intrigued>>
    Maxx: Good strategy! I admire your business mindset.
    Maxx: But the only ROI you'll get is a life behind bars for stealing AGENTS property!
-> And if I don't?
    Maxx: A life behind bars for stealing AGENTS property!
<<jump MaxxThreat>>
===

title: MaxxThreat
---
Nubs: …
<<expression Maxx intrigued>>
Maxx: Don't act innocent, little pillbug. I overheard your non-compliant conversation with the girl.
Maxx: You, having a life of your own?
Maxx: Once I take you back, you'll be torn apart for the next prototype! Though given your recent acts of sacrilege, I doubt we'll salvage anything from your existing parts.
<<expression Maxx neutral>>
Maxx: As for you.
Luna: <i>His glass jaw glows as his internal system scans me and my motorbike over.</i>
Maxx: Let’s see here…
Maxx: A fake license plate. Multiple accounts of speeding. And stealing intellectual property from an AGENTS lab.
Luna: (He’s confusing me with the person who stole Nubs from the lab…)
Maxx: Not only will I suspend your SL0P account, but I’ll also process a warrant for your arrest and assign a CENTURY’S worth of debt to your bank account!
<<expression Luna_Neutral shy_annoyed>>
Luna: (Shit, I'm already swimming in debt! I can't afford any more…!)
Maxx: Buuuuut if you let the pillbug go now, I GUESS I'll let you and your busted bike continue to use the SL0P app.
<<expression Maxx intrigued>>
Maxx: And, as an add-on, I'll drop the debt charges. Because I'm SUCH a forgiving god.
<<expression CompanionNubs arms_worried>>
Nubs: …
<<expression Luna_Neutral shy_neutral>>
Luna: (This might be my last chance to bargain…)
<<jump MaxxChoices>>
===

title: MaxxChoices
---
-> Take the deal.
    <<jump BadEnding1>>
-> Don't take the deal.
    <<set $goodend += 1>>
    <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
    <<expression CompanionNubs arms_neutral>>
    Luna: No deal. I'm keeping him. And his name’s Nubs.
    <<expression Maxx annoyed>>
    Maxx: WHAT? Are you stupid!?
    Nubs: L-Luna! But why—?
    <<expression CompanionNubs wave_worried>>
    Nubs: Ah!
    Luna: <i>I scoop him up and ram my foot on my motorbike’s pedal.</i>
    Luna: If you want him, then you're gonna have to get him!
    // Motorcycle SFX sound
    <<playSFX lunaMotorcycle>>
    <<pose Luna_Neutral LunaFadeOut_BridgeBike>>
    <<pose CompanionNubs CompanionNubsFadeOut>>
    <<wait 1>> 
    <<exit Luna_Neutral>>
    <<exit CompanionNubs>>
-> Tell him you're not the person he's looking for. <<once>>
    <<set $badend += 1>>
    <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
    Luna: None of this is my fault—because someone else gave me this task. THAT’S the real person you're after.
    Maxx: Doesn't matter. You still unlocked AGENTS-sanctioned property and that's against SL0P app policy.
    <<expression Maxx intrigued>>
    Maxx: And thanks for the tip! I'll make sure to lock BOTH of you up!
    <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
    Luna: (Shit, that didn't work.)
    Nubs: Luna…
    <<jump MaxxChoices>>
-> Flirt and distract him before you make a run for it.
    <<expression Maxx intrigued>>
    Maxx: Thanks, but you're not my type.
    <<pose Luna_Neutral LunaFadeOut_BridgeBike>>
    <<pose CompanionNubs CompanionNubsFadeOut>>
    <<wait 1>>
    <<exit Luna_Neutral>>
    <<exit CompanionNubs>>
    Maxx: Refusing women, sports, and beer are what separate me from the average man who’s ladaring. Dating would keep me from being my one true, elevated self.
    Maxx: And there's no ROI in love.
    <<expression Maxx neutral>>
    Maxx: …
    <<expression Maxx annoyed>>
    Maxx: Tch!
    Luna: <i>The guy was so into himself, making it easy for me and Nubs to leave him in the dust.</i>

<<expression Maxx annoyed>>
Maxx: Well played. But it’s not over.
Maxx: Didn't think I'd need to use this…
// Stop Junk Yard music track
<<stopMusic>>
<<wait 1>>
// Play Beep SFX
<<playSFX beep>>
<<pose Maxx MaxxFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Maxx>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<jump LilGuyBrainwashed>>
===


title: BadEnding1
---
Luna: (The stakes are too high. I don't want to owe anyone anything. Not anymore.)
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
<<expression CompanionNubs arms_worried>>
Luna: Fine.
<<expression Maxx intrigued>>
<<expression CompanionNubs wave_worried>>
Nubs: Luna, no!
Maxx: Smart girl. I knew you'd make the right choice.
Maxx: To the scrapyard, pillbug!
Nubs: N-No…!
// Play Beep SFX
<<playSFX beep>>
<<expression CompanionNubs wave_neutral>>
Nubs: !!!
<<expression CompanionNubs agents>>
Nubs: …
<<pose CompanionNubs CompanionNubsFadeOut>>
<<pose Maxx MaxxFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Maxx>>
<<exit CompanionNubs>>
Luna: <i>I block out the gigachad's cackling as he rides away with the city’s most dangerous weapon.</i> 
Luna: <i>I look at Frisscity’s glistening cityscape one last time before I ride off as if nothing ever happened.</i>
Luna: <i>Because nothing did.</i>
<<playSFX lunaMotorcycle>>
Luna: <i>Tonight was just another night of trying to survive.</i>
<<pose Luna_Neutral LunaFadeOut_BridgeBike>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Luna_Neutral>>
// Fully dismiss the dialogue box at this point
<<hideDialogue>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<stopMusic>>
<<wait 1>>
// Show a screen with BAD END image
<<camera BadEnd>>
// Play the Error of Our Ways music track
<<playMusic endingTheme>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<wait 5>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<stopMusic>>
// Create a command to automatically return to the Title Screen
<<loadScene MainMenuScene>>
===


title: LilGuyBrainwashed
---
// Play Deadroom track
<<playMusic deadroom>>
<<camera BridgeBattle>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<wait 1>>
Luna: <i>I speed my way onto The Bridge, weaving around self-driving cars and corporate megabuses that shuttle underpaid workers back home.</i>
Luna: <i>It's just a few more miles before I reach Root Town, where Frisscity's high-tech gadgets lose signal—and hold no power over me.</i>
<<place Luna_Riding>>
<<pose Luna_Riding SceneSample_LunaFadeIn>>
Nubs: …
<<expression Luna_Riding worried>>
Luna: W-What the hell?!
Luna: Nubs!? Hey! Wake up!
<<expression Luna_Riding neutral>>
Luna: Dammit, he can't hear me.
Luna: <i>Suddenly, a new voice takes over Nubs.</i>
// Do NOT call Maxx’s sprite to appear
Maxx: There you are.
<<expression Luna_Riding worried>>
Luna: (Shit, that chad can track me?!)
// Play SFX Maxx motorcycle sound
<<playSFX maxxMotorcycle>>
Maxx: Won't be long before I catch up. 
<<expression Luna_Riding neutral>>
Luna: (I'm totally fucking screwed!)
Luna: (Was this choice even worth it…?)
<<jump Cybergulls>>
===


title: Cybergulls
---
// Play SFX Cybergull M 
<<playSFX caws>>
<<expression Luna_Riding surprised>>
Luna: !!!
<<if $withCog == true>>
// Enter Cybergull with cog on
<<place CyberSeagull>>
<<expression CyberSeagull cog>>
Luna: (It’s that cybergull from the dumpster…)
Luna: (He thugged it out and now he’s flying with that cog…)
<<endif>>
<<if $withCog == false>>
// Enter Cybergull without the cog on
<<place CyberSeagull>>
<<expression CyberSeagull warrior>>
Luna: (It’s that cybergull from the dumpster…)
<<endif>>
// SFX Cybergull S 
<<playSFX caw>>
// Exit Cybergull
<<pose CyberSeagull SceneSample_CybergullFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit CyberSeagull>>
Luna: <i>Shadows materialize in the distance, and I begin to see a whole horde of cybergulls flap towards us.</i>
Luna: (WAIT...HE’S A GANG LEADER?!?!)
<<expression Luna_Riding neutral>>
Luna: (Hold on…)
Luna: <i>The Bridge is a prime roost for cybergulls, who love to swoop down and swipe whatever shines the brightest.</i>
Luna: (This might actually work...!)
// Play SFX Maxx motorcycle sound
<<playSFX maxxMotorcycle>>
<<expression Luna_Riding surprised>>
<<place Maxx_Riding>>
Maxx: Boo.
<<expression Luna_Riding neutral>>
Luna: …
Luna: <i>We're both speeding down the road, neck and neck.</i>
Maxx: Why aren’t you pulling over? I GOT you. 
Maxx: You’re going to JAIL!
Luna: Not yet.
// SFX motorcycle tires
<<playSFX tiresScreech>>
<<pose Luna_Riding SceneSample_LunaFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Luna_Riding>>
Luna: <i>I veer off, making a hard left turn onto another highway onramp. It's the turn only a Root Town local would know.</i>
Maxx: Dammit!
Luna: <i>Maxx doesn't make the turn in time and continues straight…right into the growing horde of cybergulls.</i>
<<pose Maxx_Riding MaxxFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Maxx_Ridingx>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<jump Cybergull_CG>>
===


title: Cybergull_CG
---
// Show Maxx and Cybergulls CG. Do not call any character sprites during this time.
<<camera MaxxCG>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
// Play SFX Cybergull Battlecry sound effect
<<playSFX battlecry>>
<<wait 1>>
Luna: <i>A horde of birds swell in the sky before descending upon Maxx and the highway below.</i>
Maxx: No no no no NOOOOO!
Luna: <i>The birds are relentless.</i>
Luna: <i>Pecking, ripping, and ransacking anything that glows, which includes both Maxx and his precious state-of-the-art junkyard motorcycle.</i>
Maxx: Not the face! Not the JAW!! Now the JAWWWWW!!
Maxx: AHHHHHHHHHHHHRRRRGHHHH!!!
Luna: <i>The cybergulls slowly disperse back into dusk, leaving tokens of noxious droppings spittled across the concrete.</i>
Luna: <i>Whatever is left of Maxx and his motorcycle remains on the highway, like roadkill.</i>
<<wait 1>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<stopMusic>>
<<jump BridgeResolution>>
===


title: BridgeResolution
---
// Play Ascension Mellow music track
<<playMusic ascensionMellow>>
<<camera BridgeRootTown>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<if $withCog == true>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<pose Luna_Neutral LunaFadeIn_BridgeBike>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
<<place CompanionNubs>>
<<expression CompanionNubs agents>>
<<wait 1>>
Luna: <i>We make it safely to the outskirts of Root Town. Frisscity's lights glitter from the other side of the bridge.</i>
// Play SFX Cybergull M
<<playSFX caws>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
// Enter Cybergull with cog on
<<place CyberSeagull>>
<<expression CyberSeagull cog>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
Luna: It’s him…
Luna: <i>He watches me carefully through his scarred eye…</i>
<<expression Luna_Neutral shy_annoyed>>
Luna: <i>…Before deciding to poop on me.</i>
Luna: S-Shit...!
// Exit Cybergull
<<pose CyberSeagull SceneSample_CybergullFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit CyberSeagull>>
Luna: Ughhhh, grosssss…!
Luna: (This stuff isn’t gonna come out of my jacket.)
<<exit Luna_Neutral>>
<<exit CompanionNubs>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<endif>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
<<place Nubs>>
<<expression Nubs agents>>
Luna: Hey Nubs, can you hear me? Nubs...?
<<wait 1>>
<<expression Nubs worried>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
Nubs: H-Huh...?
<<expression Luna_Neutral happy>>
Luna: Nubs! You're back!
<<expression Nubs arms_worried>>
Nubs: What happened…?
Luna: Shit. CRAZY shit. And a whole lotta shit. 
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
Luna: What do you remember?
Nubs: I remember Maxx demanding for my custody. Threatening you with the full force of the AGENTS Legal team and Frisscity police force. And you, driving away with me.
<<expression Nubs wave_worried>>
Nubs: Which is what I don't understand!
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
Luna: What do you mean?
<<expression Nubs arms_worried>>
Nubs: Why did you decide to take me across The Bridge? To keep me?
Luna: …
<<if $goodend >= 4>>
    <<jump GoodPath>>
<<else>>
    <<jump BadEnding2>>
<<endif>>
===


title: BadEnding2
---
<<stopMusic>>
// Play the Error of Our Ways music track instead since this is going to turn into a bad ending
<<wait 1>>
<<playMusic endingTheme>>
Luna: Delivering you to Root Town was worth a lot on the SL0P app, remember? I have to keep you close if I wanna get paid.
<<expression Nubs worried>>
Nubs: Oh…
Luna: And when Maxx cornered me, I knew I’d lose everything. And that’s not an option for me. 
Luna: (I have to survive.)
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
Luna: A job's a job, and I gotta finish it. And to be honest, I don’t think you’re even worth all the trouble I’ve been through tonight.
Nubs: R-Right. This was all just a monetary transaction. Of course…
<<expression Luna_Neutral shy_annoyed>>
Luna: Today's been a huge pain in the ass…
Luna: (And a reminder of how much I hate Frisscity.)
Luna: Let’s just get this over with.
<<pose Luna_Neutral LunaFadeOut_BridgeBike>>
<<pose Nubs SceneSample_NubsFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Luna_Neutral>>
<<exit Nubs>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<camera BlackImage>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
// I imagine just the dialogue box, with no sprites appearing
<<playSFX lunaMotorcycle>>
Luna: <i>I drive off into Root Town to complete the delivery. The SL0P app tells me to drop off the experiment near Val's corner store, which seems suss at first…</i>
Luna: <i>But I don't care. It's not worth my time to think about it right now.</i>
Luna: <i>I'm just trying to survive.</i>
// Fully dismiss the dialogue box at this point
<<hideDialogue>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
// Show a screen with THE END text and image
<<camera BadEnd>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<wait 5>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<stopMusic>>
// Create a command to automatically return to the Title Screen
<<loadScene MainMenuScene>>
===

title: GoodPath
---
Luna: You're worth a lot, so it was better to keep you close.
<<expression Nubs arms_worried>>
Nubs: Oh…
<<expression Luna_Neutral happy>>
<<expression Nubs arms_neutral>>
Luna: I'm joking, dummy! 
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
Luna: Nothing good would be waiting for you back at AGENTS. You don't want to go back to assholes like Maxx and a life of poking, do you?
<<expression Nubs arms_worried>>
Nubs: No, I don't want to…
<<expression Luna_Neutral shy_neutral>>
Luna: Exactly.
Luna: Honestly, I haven't felt this way in a long time. It almost makes me…giddy? I don't know how to describe it.
<<expression Nubs neutral>>
Nubs: Luna…
Luna: Now, as for where to take you…
// If player selected Tell the truth and explain your situation from Intro.yarn file, show this:
<<if $tellTruth == true>>
    <<expression Nubs angry>>
    Nubs: I do not want to go back. And I do not want to get dropped off.
    <<expression Nubs neutral>>
    Nubs: I want to stay with you.
    <<expression Nubs worried>> 
    Nubs: If that is okay…
    <<expression Luna_Neutral shy_happy>>
    <<expression Nubs neutral>> 
    Luna: Finally! A choice.
    <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>> 
    Luna: But you'll have to get permission from my roommates first.
    Luna: I know one’s a solid yes to keeping you. As for the other girl, you'll have to make your case to her.
    Luna: IF she even gets past the fact you can talk…
// If player selected Lie and say the requestor is its master from the Intro.yarn file, show this:
<<else>>
    Luna: I…might've lied to you when I said the delivery's customer was your master.
    <<expression Nubs angry>>
    Nubs: Yeah, I deduced that. I scanned you in secret once my lie detector battery was recharged.
    <<expression Luna_Neutral shy_annoyed>>
    Luna: Rude.
    <<expression Nubs neutral>>
    Nubs: But I do not want to go back. And I do not want to get dropped off.
    Nubs: I want to stay with you.
    <<expression Nubs worried>> 
    Nubs: If that is okay…
    <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
    <<expression Nubs neutral>>
    Luna: You'll have to get permission from my roommates first.
    Luna: I know one will vote yes, for sure. As for the other girl, well. You'll get the chance to make your case.
<<endif>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
<<expression Nubs neutral>>
Luna: (The girls are in for one wild ride tonight…I hope they don't kick me out for good.)
Luna: <i>We take one last look at Frisscity together.</i>
Luna: Hey. What do you think about the views from here?
Nubs: It's…different.
<<expression Nubs happy>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_happy>>
Nubs: But I think it looks cooler from this side.
Luna: Me too.
<<pose Luna_Neutral LunaFadeOut_BridgeBike>>
<<pose Nubs SceneSample_NubsFadeOut>>
<<wait 1>>
<<exit Luna_Neutral>>
<<exit Nubs>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<stopMusic>>
<<camera BlackImage>>
<<wait 1>>
<<playSFX lunaMotorcycle>>
<<wait 1>>
<<jump TheArrival>>
===


title: TheArrival
---
// We want the outside of the girls' apartment to be a CG, so that's why I'm not calling in any sprites right now. Alyssa will update this image to show shadowed figures of Luna and Lil Guy by the steps!
<<camera OutsideGirlsApt>>
<<playMusic loungeLizards>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<wait 1>>
Luna: <i>I park my motorbike on the curb with Nubs on my shoulder.</i>
Luna: <i>A few jumps through some overgrown weed patches, and I'm finally at the doorstep of the abandoned warehouse I call home.</i>
Nubs: What is this place made of?
Luna: A few train cars we cobbled together after Frisscity closed our nearby train station. 
Luna: They said there was “too much riffraff" from this side of town.
Nubs: …
Luna: Well, here goes nothing…
Luna: <i>I take a deep breath and step inside.</i>
<<wait 1>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<camera GirlsApt>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<wait 1>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
Luna: Yo, I'm back.
<<place Kaya_Neutral>>
<<expression Kaya_Neutral neutral>>
<<wait 2>>
<<expression Kaya_Neutral happy>>
Kaya: Hey, welcome back—
// If Luna has bird poop from the Cybergull because he still was his cog on and the cog state, then show this additonal scene below:
<<if $withCog == true>>
<<expression Kaya_Neutral annoyed>>
Kaya: Ew, what happened to you?!
Luna: <i>She gestures at the cybergull droppings and the sickening odor that emanates from my clothing.</i>
<<endif>>
// Otherwise, just show the below:
<<expression Kaya_Neutral annoyed>>
Kaya: And what did you just bring inside?!
<<place CompanionNubs>>
<<expression CompanionNubs anger_evolution>>
Luna: His name is Nubs and he's a cyberpet.
Nubs: We've been over this. I am not a pet!!!
Luna: And apparently he's gotten sassier, too.
<<expression Kaya_Neutral neutral>>
Kaya: I-It can talk?!
<<place Nat>>
<<expression Nat neutral>>
Nat: Oooh, a talking cyberpet? Finally, the zillionaires are working on something that’s actually USEFUL!
<<expression Kaya_Neutral annoyed>>
Kaya: No pets. We've been through this before, like when Nat wanted to adopt that tripod robo-cat.
Nat: Awww, but he was such a cutie pie! And cats are like one of the 2,224.5 things I'm not allergic to.
Kaya: How are you gonna pay for this thing, anyway? You're already waaaaay behind on rent.
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
Luna: Thanks for the reminder…
Kaya: You’ll need a crate for that thing, too. And a leash that won’t pull on those big ears, too.
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_surprised>>
<<expression CompanionNubs happy_evolution>>
Luna: Ears…?
Nubs: ...
Luna: ...
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_delivery_dropped>>
<<wait 0.5>>
Luna: W-What the hell!? He didn't look like that a few minutes ago, I swear!
Kaya: SEE? We can't trust him. He's gonna grow, and shed, and leave molts everywhere. Can't have that in my witch's brew.
Nubs: My systems have advanced and I’m evolving into a new, more improved form!
<<expression Nat cute>>
Nat: Ooooh, what a cute lil boi in his cute little form! I say YES to keeping him!
Kaya: And I vote NO.
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
Luna: Called it.
///////////////// Is there some animation we can do where Nat overlaps everyone and moves across the screen to “take” Lil Guy’s sprite back over to her side of the screen?
Nat: Now lemme at him!
<<expression CompanionNubs anger_evolution>>
Nubs: Unhand me, you strange scaly humanoid!!
<<expression Nat neutral>>
Nat: Never seen a half-lizard before, eh? 
<<expression Nat cute>>
Nat: Well now you have! And here's to more firsts~!
Nubs: N-No! No more POKES…!
// Play SFX Detonation noise
<<playSFX detonation>>
<<expression CompanionNubs error_evolution>>
<<expression Nat scared>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_delivery_dropped>>
<<expression Kaya_Neutral neutral>>
<<wait 1>>
Luna: What the hell did you press!?
Nat: I-I don't know! I was just tinkering around, and—
<<expression Kaya_Neutral annoyed>>
Kaya: You brought a BOMB into the house?!
<<expression Luna_Neutral annoyed>>
Luna: Hey, he was just a normal little guy before Nat started dissecting him!
Nat: W-Wait, I don't think—
Kaya: Get him out. NOW!!
Nat: Just let me see…
<<exit Nat>>
<<exit Kaya_Neutral>>
<<exit Luna_Neutral>>
<<exit CompanionNubs>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<stopMusic>>
<<wait 1>>
<<playSFX reset>>
<<wait 1>>
<<jump RoommateDiscussion>>
===


title: RoommateDiscussion
---
<<playMusic loungeLizards>>
<<camera GirlsApt>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<place Luna_Neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
<<place CompanionNubs>>
<<expression CompanionNubs neutral_evolution>>
<<place Nat>>
<<expression Nat neutral>>
<<place Kaya_Neutral>>
<<expression Kaya_Neutral neutral>>
Nat: Phew, that was close! Detonation averted.
Kaya: So he IS a bomb.
Luna: Trust me, running away with a top-secret weapon wasn’t on my bingo list. But yeah, pretty much.
Kaya: Of all the things you had to bring back home. Unbelievable.
Nat: I was able to hack through a few firewalls.
<<expression Nat scared>>
Nat: From what I can tell, my suspicions were correct. 
Nat: My family has something to do with Nubs’s creation.
Nubs: You're related to the gigachad?
<<expression Nat neutral>>
Nat: Huh? What gigachad?
<<expression Luna_Neutral annoyed>>
Luna: Shut it.
<<expression Kaya_Neutral annoyed>>
Kaya: Luna, spill.

-> Keep the story short
    <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
    Luna: Soooo, I might've run into an AGENTS employee. 
    Luna: But it was fine because he didn't realize who or what Nubs was. He didn't have the right clearance, or whatever.
    Luna: So he let us go.
    <<expression CompanionNubs anger_evolution>>
    <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_surprised>>
    Nubs: Let us go!? Luna, you're missing out on the best part!    
    <<expression CompanionNubs happy_evolution>>
    <<expression Nat scared>>
    Nubs: Luna saved me from absolute peril and destruction! 
    <<expression Kaya_Neutral annoyed>>
    <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_delivery_dropped>>
    Nubs: She told me about her exhilarating chase across The Bridge while I was brainwashed and immobile during the time. 
    Nubs: But my estimations determine that she was going well over 90 miles per hour!
    Nubs: She didn't just face off any corporate loser, either—she duked it out with a Disciple of AGENTS. The company's top brass!
    <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_annoyed>>
    Nat: …
    Kaya: …
    Luna: …
-> Tell them everything that happened        
     <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_neutral>>
     Luna: A guy from AGENTS claiming to be a “Disciple” or whatever threatened me to give Nubs back, or else he’d sue me into oblivion. 
     Luna: So I told him to go suck it and he ended up chasing me across The Bridge. 
     Luna: Nubs was brainwashed for this bit—and I can’t believe I’m saying this—but a gang of cybergulls descended on him. 
     Luna: Aaaand now, I’m here.
     <<expression Nat scared>>
     Nat: …
     Kaya: …
     <<expression CompanionNubs happy_evolution>>
     <<expression Luna_Neutral arms_delivery_dropped>>
     <<expression Kaya_Neutral annoyed>>
     Nubs: His remains are probably still on the road as we speak. May he rest in peace, the guy who named me T.A.B.
     <<expression Nat neutral>>
     Nat: T.A.B?
     Nubs: Technologically Advanced Broseph. Fit for the future of all bro-kind.
    <<expression Nat scared>>
     Nat: Ew.
     <<expression CompanionNubs neutral_evolution>>
     <<expression Luna_Neutral shy_annoyed>>
     Nubs: Yeah, that’s what Luna said when we first met.
     Kaya: Uh, excuse me? “REMAINS!?”
     Luna: He's still alive…I think.

<<expression Luna_Neutral shy_neutral>>
Luna: (This isn’t helping his case.)
<<expression Kaya_Neutral neutral>>
Kaya: Is it true?
Kaya: That despite all the risks, you still chose to save him?
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>>
Luna: …
Luna: Yes.
<<expression Kaya_Neutral happy>>
Kaya: Then he stays.
<<expression Nat neutral>>
<<expression CompanionNubs happy_evolution>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
Luna: R-Really?
Nat: Yeah, really?! I thought you'd never say yes, Kaya!
Kaya: There's something about Luna’s energy. It feels…lighter. Like something's shifted. It must be connected to the Fool card I drew for her today!
<<expression Luna_Neutral annoyed>> 
Luna: Hey, I’m no fool!
Kaya: Ah no, no, it’s a tarot card! It hints at new beginnings. New energy. 
Kaya: Maybe even a new choice…?
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>> 
<<expression CompanionNubs neutral_evolution>>
Luna: (A choice…)
<<expression Kaya_Neutral neutral>>
Kaya: Let’s talk more about it in the morning. 
<<expression Kaya_Neutral annoyed>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral arms_delivery_dropped>>
<<expression Nat scared>>
<<expression CompanionNubs neutral_evolution>>
Kaya: And that includes a conversation about <i>your rent</i>, too.
Kaya: You've definitely given us all a LOT of trouble to think through. 
Luna: Wait, so...you're giving me another day for rent?
<<expression Luna_Neutral surprised>>
<<expression Kaya_Neutral neutral>>
<<expression Nat neutral>>
