Nubs: Hey!
<<else>>
Luna: Fool it is...
<<endif>>
<<expression Nat neutral>>
<<expression Luna_Neutral neutral>> 
Nat: YAY! Hopefully I'll be able to find out more answers, too. 
<<expression CompanionNubs neutral_evolution>>
<<expression Kaya_Neutral neutral>>
Nat: I’ll keep inspecting Nubs’s code tomorrow and see what else I can find. I’ve already copied his entire codebase onto my drive.
Nubs: I would also like to know what's beyond those firewalls. And what my purpose was…
