title: Foreshadowing
---
// Show a black screen. No sprites, just the dialogue box with the following names for the character nameplates.
<<camera BlackImage>>
// Play Underground Lab music track
<<playMusic lab>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<wait 1>>
The Big Bad: Dammit! The failsafe switch for Experiment 184 was destroyed.  
Incompetent Director: In due time, master. We'll find it. It's most likely hiding away in Root Town.
The Big Bad: SOMEONE is hiding him. And if they get their hands on the code…
Incompetent Director: They won't. It's behind 800 unique firewalls.
Incompetent Director: I'll start searching for the experiment tomorrow. Root Town is under my supervision, after all.
// Play SFX Maxx metal grinding in the background
<<playSFX grinder>>
The Big Bad: Go there NOW. I can't afford having that thing on the loose.
Incompetent Director: As you wish, master.
Incompetent Director: Oh, also. In the most non-awkward, non-opportunistic way possible…what are we doing about Maxx?
Incompetent Director: I know he was up for the same promotion as me. 
Incompetent Director: And don’t get me wrong, he’s done a lot of…guerrilla marketing for our cause. 
Incompetent Director: But after the state we found him in on The Bridge, I'm just not sure the "Evangelist" title is in the cards for him right now—
The Big Bad: Maxx no longer works for the company. 
The Big Bad: Though he'll still be working. Just in a more…useful capacity.
The Big Bad: In fact, he's being repurposed as we speak... 
// Dismiss the dialogue box in this moment for the ending
<<hideDialogue>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<stopMusic>>
<<wait 1>>
// Play the Error of Our Ways music track
<<playMusic endingTheme>>
// Show a screen with “THE END? (TO BE CONTINUED…)” text for the good end.
<<camera GoodEnd>>
<<fadeIn 2>>
<<wait 5>>
<<fadeOut 2>>
<<stopMusic>>
// Create a command to automatically return to the Title Screen
<<loadScene MainMenuScene>>
